WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.349 --> 00:00:01.277
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:01.963 --> 00:00:04.950
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There was a strange noise outside our door.

3
00:00:06.732 --> 00:00:07.587
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

4
00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.935
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There weren’t any more strange noises.

5
00:00:12.477 --> 00:00:13.560
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

6
00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:17.149
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We knew that people said there were ghosts.

7
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:19.726
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

8
00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:23.749
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There wasn’t anybody in that room last night.